  "body": "Price guide - ENQ OVER $1,800,000 \r\n\r\nFreehold, brand new, terrace home with a blend of contemporary design and convenience ideal for downsizers or those seeking a low maintenance life style. \r\n\r\n- 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n- 3 modern bathrooms\r\n- 2 well-separated living areas with lift access\r\n- Ample garage space and storage areas\r\n- Low maintenance, ideal for downsizers or busy professionals\r\n- Easy stroll to waterfront, local cafes, and central CBD location\r\n- Sunny, warm, and contemporary design throughout\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n- Spend your time enjoying life, not maintaining your home\r\n- Modern, easy-care living with all conveniences at your doorstep\r\n- Perfect for home ownership or a strategic rental investment\r\n- Strong vendor instructions to sell - opportunity should not be missed\r\n\r\nVendor prepared to guarantee a generous rental return for approved purchasers for an initial period. Sunny, warm, and beautifully designed home, Ready for immediate enjoyment or investment. Book a viewing today before this opportunity is gone.",
